<h1>SolarEdge Site Connected</h1>

<p>
  Consent has been given for us to access data for the SolarEdge monitoring system with
  site id <%= @installation.site_id %> for <%= @installation.school.name %>
</p>

<% if @installation.api_key.present? %>
  <p>
    This is an existing SolarEdge site using the v1 API. Nothing else needs to be done at this time.
  </p>
<% else %>
  <p>
    This is an new SolarEdge site without an API key. We will start loading data for this site once we have implemented
    v2 of the Solar Edge API.
  </p>
<% end %>

<p>
  <%= link_to 'View solar feeds', school_solar_feeds_configuration_index_url(@installation.school) %>
</p>
